      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet x = 0.0\nlet y = x * .infinity\n// y is a NaN\n\n// Comparing with the equal-to operator never returns 'true'\nprint(x == Double.nan)\n// Prints \"false\"\nprint(y == Double.nan)\n// Prints \"false\"\n\n// Test with the 'isNaN' property instead\nprint(x.isNaN)\n// Prints \"false\"\nprint(y.isNaN)\n// Prints \"true\"\n```",
